    "api_error_status": null,
    "result": "## \u2705 Bug Fixed\n\nThe issue was in `/packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts` at lines 737-755. The `gate` command was only capturing positional arguments via `[args...]`, which meant the `--ci` flag wasn't being passed through to the frai-gate CLI.\n\n**The fix:** Changed the argument passing to capture all remaining arguments from `process.argv` after the `gate` command, including flags. This ensures that options like `--ci` are properly forwarded to the frai-gate CLI.\n\n**Changes made:**\n- Modified the gate command's action handler to extract all arguments after `gate` from `process.argv` instead of relying solely on the parsed `args` parameter\n- This allows both positional arguments and flags to be passed through correctly\n\n**Verification:**\n- Rebuilt the package with `pnpm --filter frai build`\n- Tested `frai gate init --ci` and confirmed both files are now created:\n  - \u2705 `FRAI-SPEC.md` \n  - \u2705 `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`",
